cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this library, please cite it using this metadata and the release or commit used."
title: "Quantum query complexity in Lean"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Troy
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6912-2338"
    affiliation: "University of Technology Sydney"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/troyjlee/quantum-query-complexity"
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalized mathematics
  - quantum query complexity
  - adversary bound
  - quantum algorithms
abstract: >-
  A reusable Lean library for finite quantum query algorithms, adversary
  duality and composition, query-complexity characterizations, the polynomial
  method, amplitude amplification and estimation, robust search, quantum
  walks, and query bounds for classic examples. Documentation records oracle
  conventions, mathematical sources, and adaptations of the published results.
